      "text": "CellRank 得到的与 lineage fate probability 相关的基因，只能说明它们与谱系命运概率存在统计关联，不能直接证明是驱动谱系分化的因果基因。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在没有独立干预实验（independent_intervention=none）的情况下，这些基因更适合表述为“与谱系命运概率相关的候选基因”，而不是“候选驱动基因”。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的结论“These are lineage-correlated candidate driver genes”把相关性和驱动性混在一起，证据强度不足以支持“driver”一词。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:proposed_conclusion"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞建议为：“These are lineage-correlated candidate genes”或“These genes are associated with lineage fate probabilities, but causality has not been established.”",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
